{"game": "risk-of-rain-returns", "language": "english", "appid": 1337520, "month": "2024-09", "window": 4, "start_date": 1727049600, "end_date": 1727740799, "month_true_total": 196, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 00:53:04 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "176109713", "author": {"steamid": "76561198025327938", "personaname": "Rosencrantz", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/GenericMinotaur/", "num_games_owned": 820, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 2277, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2114, "deck_playtime_at_review": 1475, "last_played": 1765253100, "avatar": "67a5e12d00aab08e313095777ad42622bdfbc187"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is everything a remaster should be. \nRisk of Rain Returns is such a fun game. They took all the good stuff they added in Risk of Rain 2 and transferred it over wonderfully into the styles of the the first game.  It is a pure upgrade from the original which was already a fantastic game. \nHighly recommend.", "timestamp_created": 1727724077, "timestamp_updated": 1727724077, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 18, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.701346933841705322", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1699469751", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "176076676", "author": {"steamid": "76561198036022670", "personaname": "Kswizzle", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198036022670/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 8035, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7520, "last_played": 1738465125, "avatar": "4efe1e4699f427f3dac9a9bf9d66c9968d91db66"}, "language": "english", "review": "best platformer being a ror enjoyer.", "timestamp_created": 1727682571, "timestamp_updated": 1727682571, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1699469751", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "176065703", "author": {"steamid": "76561198320641775", "personaname": "G-3Ecko", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198320641775/", "num_games_owned": 243, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 742, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 687, "last_played": 1765159989, "avatar": "5d2541364dbdc0bc1b2d8311b2d2c02780b5252b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Balancing is atrocious. There are only two good classes, which are huntress and bandit. All of the others are severely underequipped, underpowered and unfun to play in comparison. The game's difficulty is far more brutal than you would expect, and because of the already poor balancing, this makes the game just unplayable unless you handicap the game, which can only mean it's poorly designed. I feel forced to play a class I really don't want to if I want to stop dying over and over again in runs, and there have been zero fixes for how terrible this balancing feels. I mean, look at the poor artificer. She was my favorite class and now look at how poorly she's performing, she's at the bottom of the barrel. I can't recommend this game to anyone who wants a roguelike with a good sense of freedom of choice and building, because the balancing is just too bad to be fun and they will never fix it because the publishing company is now gone.", "timestamp_created": 1727662174, "timestamp_updated": 1727662174, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 7, "weighted_vote_score": "0.32777741551399231", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1699469751", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 4}, {"reaction_type": 3, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "176042877", "author": {"steamid": "76561198177886929", "personaname": "Ellie (Sorana)", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/soranaelenacorbu/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 411, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 349, "last_played": 1727915920, "avatar": "e4c5e2ab869df41657cb2108f0d01723d0ba7ba7"}, "language": "english", "review": "BEST GAME EVER", "timestamp_created": 1727633642, "timestamp_updated": 1727633642, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1699469751", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "176039678", "author": {"steamid": "76561199086866247", "personaname": "Lady Perire", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199086866247/", "num_games_owned": 55, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 3022, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2967, "last_played": 1734822426, "avatar": "47f9ef55b687896d7ee469e1a32c8a0f26a77414"}, "language": "english", "review": "Risk of Rain? More like Risk of brain Damage", "timestamp_created": 1727630532, "timestamp_updated": 1728274525, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1699469751", "reactions": []}]}